{{en-noun|lines of beauty}}

# {{lb|en|fine arts}} An [[abstract]] line supposed to be beautiful in itself and [[absolutely]]; differently represented by different authors, often as a kind of elongated S (like the one drawn by {{w|William Hogarth|Hogarth}}).

